   "The mountains around this village are where the future saint grew up before he walked south to a monastery.": 1,
   "The road south from here leads to the monastery, the tomb and the hermitage. Follow it on": 1,
   "This is the setting of Charbel's first years, long before the quiet of Annaya.": 1,
   "This is where his earliest life can still be visited. More in": 1,
   "Tradition says that as a boy minding the family's animals he often prayed in a grotto just outside the village, kneeling before an image of Mary. Villagers now call it the Saint's Grotto.": 1,
